    "The proposed development, due to its size, design and location within close proximity of the footway, would eroded the openness of the corner plot to the detriment of the character of the St Helier Estate, appearing out-of-keeping, cramped and visually intrusive. As such, it is considered that the design of the proposal is unacceptable and causes harm to the character of the streetscene contrary to policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018."
